  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tempura relies on a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tempura batter",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tempura-batter"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " kept as cold as possible so it does not develop gluten. When it hits hot oil, the water in the batter turns to steam instantly, creating a feather-light, blistered crust. Serve with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tentsuyu",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tentsuyu"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dipping sauce. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fry in small batches only. Crowding the oil drops its temperature and turns the batter greasy rather than crisp."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
